--- !u!114 &800262119
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 800262118}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f0b1957e58b21904c8709a771b48930b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  mainDialogue:
    name: Josephine
    mood: 
    sentences:
    - Jesse, you made it! Welcome to Twilight Inc. I'm Josephine and it looks like
      we are going to be partner dreamweavers.
    - Twilight Inc. is one of the few companies that offer clients the ability to
      live in a perfect world.
    - 'It is all an illusion of course. '
    - Our clients consider life very boring now ever since almost every job got automated
      away with smart tech.
    - Our priority is to create a fantastic dream world so that our clients can experience
      a life full of meaning again.
    - But of course you knew this already, you applied for the place after all.
    - Corporate just requires me to go through all this before we start.
  secondDialogue:
    name: Jesse
    mood: 
    sentences:
    - Thank you very much. I am very excited to be here. I never would have imagined
      that I could work here because you know...
    - It isn't very common for people to land a job here if they don't already have
      family or friends on the inside.
  thirdDialogue:
    name: Josephine
    mood: 
    sentences:
    - You're right, and I know that Twilight has been criticized for that.
    - That is why we have this new program to bring in some talented diversity.
    - I, personally, am excited. We should tap into the creative power of as many
      people as we can.
    - I can't wait to see what you can do. Let's get started.
  fourthDialogue:
    name: 
    mood: 
    sentences: []
  isChainDialogueTrigger: 0
  hasChainDialogueTrigger: 0
  chainDialogueTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  nextScene: Level 4
